\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {3}{\ignorespaces PPO training curves. Mean episode return vs.\ PPO iteration (bold: 20-iteration rolling average; shading: raw). Diamond markers indicate the evaluation checkpoint. All three from-scratch RL variants plateau below full clearing (Table~\ref {tab:results}). BC$\to $RL reaches the highest return but degrades after $\sim $500 iterations, motivating early stopping. Bottom panels decompose the reward into per-grasp components.}}{6}{figure.caption.4}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:reward_curves}{{3}{6}{PPO training curves. Mean episode return vs.\ PPO iteration (bold: 20-iteration rolling average; shading: raw). Diamond markers indicate the evaluation checkpoint. All three from-scratch RL variants plateau below full clearing (Table~\ref {tab:results}). BC$\to $RL reaches the highest return but degrades after $\sim $500 iterations, motivating early stopping. Bottom panels decompose the reward into per-grasp components}{figure.caption.4}{}}
